# Forms

Every DHIS2 data-capture form this guide publishes is a `Questionnaire`: a data set, an event
program, a tracker program's registration, or one stage of a tracker program states what is
asked, its sections become `#group` items, and each data element - or, on a registration form,
each tracked entity attribute - becomes a question typed from its DHIS2 value type. The example
`QuestionnaireResponse` instances answer these forms on the very link ids they define.

